kind":"update","title":"Steam Next Fest Demo Update: New Menu, Control Remapping & Emote Wheel!","summary":"Hi climbers! Day 5 of Next Fest brings a big quality-of-life update!Here’s what’s new:New in-game menuThe old pause menu is gone. In its place: one menu with five tabs, PLAY, CHARACTER, SETTINGS, CONTROLS and QUIT GAME, in a new teal and gold look.Control remappingYou can now rebind keyboard, mouse and controller controls.Aim zoomHold right mouse button (left trigger on controller) to zoom in over your character’s shoulder and look into the distance. Release to zoom back out. Rebindable on the C","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-23T16:56:15Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1847286114037204","verified_at":"2026-10-23T19:01:05Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4678630-1847286114032704","game_id":"steam-4678630","kind":"update","title":"Steam Next Fest Demo Update: 10 New Languages, One Climb!","summary":"Hi climbers! Until today, the demo was in English only, which meant a lot of you were playing with menus and messages in a language that isn’t yours, and we really didn’t love that. So here’s some good news: from this update, the interface and subtitles are available in your own language, and we’re kicking things off with these ten:Deutsch (German)Español (Latinoamérica)Français (French)Italiano (Italian)Polski (Polish)Português (Brasil)Русский (Russian)日本語 (Japanese)简体中文 (Simplified Chinese)한국어","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-22T13:43:54Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1847286114032704","verified_at":"2026-10-22T16:09:06Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4678630-1847286114029440","game_id":"steam-4678630","kind":"update","title":"Steam Next Fest Demo Update: Chat, Softer Rescues & Better Stability","summary":"Hey climbers! Our Next Fest Update is out!The big one is chat: you can now talk to the people on your wall. We also made rescues feel a lot nicer, reworked how long falls end, gave the altitude bar a memory, and fixed the controller navigation in the inventory and menus. Important: Please restart your Steam Client to download the update!Full notes below:Chat with other playersThe chat panel used to show only rescues, server announcements and inactivity warnings. Now it’s a real chat.Press Enter ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-21T16:08:17Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1847286114029440","verified_at":"2026-10-21T18:21:01Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4678630-1846651706696068","game_id":"steam-4678630","kind":"announcement","title":"Steam Next Fest - Day 2!","summary":"Day 2 is on! A brand new companion is hiding on the climb today: the Sneaky Hexa. Like every daily shape, it’s only around until the day turns at 00:00 PT / 07:00 UTC, and then it never drops again. Go find it!🟣 Twitch Drops are live too, with a new exclusive heart every day. Watch any Scape stream with Drops on for 30 minutes and today’s Campfire is yours.💬 Come hang out on Discord: https://discord.gg/scapethegame Joining gets you the Welcome Home companion, and our community team gives away mo","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-20T17:05:16Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706696068","verified_at":"2026-10-21T07:06:19Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4678630-1846651706690849","game_id":"steam-4678630","kind":"announcement","title":"We’re live at Steam Next Fest!","summary":"It’s happening! The demo is out right now and we are so excited to finally get it into your hands. You have until Monday, October 26 at 10:00 PT / 17:00 UTC, so grab a friend and start climbing.What’s on this week:🪐 A new companion every day. Each day of the fest has its own companion shape hiding on the climb, and when the day ends, that shape is gone for good. Today it’s the Cutesy Globe. Every find rolls its own tier and colour, so no two climbs look the same.💬 Ask our devs anything. We’re an","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-19T15:43:26Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706690849","verified_at":"2026-10-20T15:57:23Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4678630-1846651706674254","game_id":"steam-4678630","kind":"announcement","title":"Climb Night: 8pm CET Today! Come and Climb with Us!","summary":"At 8 pm CET, we’re hosting our first Climb Night on Discord. You hop into a voice channel at discord.gg/scapethegame, and we join in too!All you need is the Scape Playtest already sitting in your Steam library. A mic is nice but not required; text chat works just as well.This is our first Climb Night, so it’s a bit of an experiment. Tell us afterwards what you’d want more of. We’re also working on exclusive items for the Climb Nights after this one, something you can only pick up by being there.","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-14T13:11:57Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706674254","verified_at":"2026-10-20T15:57:23Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4678630-1846018067943455","game_id":"steam-4678630","kind":"announcement","title":"Scape Playtest is now LIVE! How to get in?","summary":"Getting in is easyGo to the Scape store page and hit Request Access under “Join the Scape Playtest”. The gates are open, so you are in straight away: Scape Playtest shows up in your library like any other game, and you can install and climb. If you requested earlier, you are in too. Thank you for being early; it means a lot!What you are playingGravity, the first game in Scape. One wall, up to 100 players on it at the same time, no checkpoints, no health bar. Fall, and wherever you land is where ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-13T09:17:34Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846018067943455","verified_at":"2026-10-20T15:57:23Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4678630-1846018067925329","game_id":"steam-4678630","kind":"announcement","title":"The Scape Discord Is Now Open! Chat, Find People to Play With and Meet the Team!","summary":"The Scape Discord is open as of today, and you are invited! Come in, grab a seat, and say hello, We are already in there waiting for you! Come and join us!Join our Discord!Click the link, finish a quick onboarding, and you are in. It takes less than a minute. What is waiting for youA place to talk about Scape. Your favourite moments, your ideas, the parts that make you shout at the screen. We want to hear all of it. People to play with. Find a group, jump in together, and see how far you get. Th","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-07T08:08:45Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846018067925329","verified_at":"2026-10-20T15:57:23Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-4678630":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T03:37:58Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T03:37:57Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-4678630":"2026-10-26T03:37:58Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"4678630":{"l